# The agent-core commit this app builds against.
#
# The :core:* Gradle projects are mapped into a separate checkout of
# https://github.com/l3ad3r1/agent-core (see settings.gradle.kts). CI reads
# the first non-comment, non-blank line of this file and checks out exactly
# that ref, so a green build names the engine it was green against.
#
# Bump this whenever an engine change lands that this app needs, and commit
# the bump together with the app-side change that depends on it. A branch
# name works but is not a pin: prefer a full 40-character SHA.
